{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062982/block/singleImage/3263019/df/01M724JETKGDH3PKKSM3D4XNSC.jpg?updatedAt=1794294545\"/><figcaption>觀塘協和街93號建德大廈。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>觀塘發生偷竊案。 今日（10日）早上11時49分，一名男子在觀塘協和街93號建德大廈對開，遇上一名女子兜搭，聲稱可提供按摩服務，男子遂跟隨該女子上樓進入單位，其間發現自己一條金頸鏈不翼而飛，懷疑被女子偷去，於是報警求助。警方接報後到場，在附近兜截無果，將男子帶返警署作進一步調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.736758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:09:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:15.679041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:19.012710+00:00","content_hash":"ea9287e22de4bf65c77f99db741dcc3ea83ab970cc1ee06195a395df27e424de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.736758+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}